8v_y7e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p009:m0169","surface":"陳頒","start":169,"end":171,"person_id":"4vc_kog_50k","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p009:m0177","surface":"周訪","start":177,"end":179,"person_id":"c6b_s71_vt7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p009:m0180","surface":"侃","start":180,"end":181,"person_id":"twd_erg_kmz","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p009:m0227","surface":"瞻","start":227,"end":228,"person_id":"5r7_x6g_gtf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p009:m0238","surface":"周訪","start":238,"end":240,"person_id":"c6b_s71_vt7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-taokan-ws1527632"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002","text":"初，王敦左遷陶侃，使廙代為荊州。將吏馬俊、鄭攀等上書請留侃，敦不許。廙為俊等所襲，奔于江安。賊杜曾與俊、攀北迎第五猗以距廙。廙督諸軍討曾，又為曾所敗。敦命湘州刺史甘卓、豫章太守周廣等助廙擊曾，曾衆潰，廙得到州。廙性俊率，嘗從南下，旦自尋陽，迅風飛帆，暮至都，倚舫樓長嘯，神氣甚逸。王導謂庾亮曰：「世將為傷時識事。」亮曰：「正足舒其逸氣耳。」廙在州大誅戮侃時將佐，及征士皇甫方回，於是大失荊土之望，人情乖阻。帝乃征廙為輔國將軍，加散騎常侍。以母喪去職。服闋，拜征虜將軍，進左衛將軍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"陶侃","kind":"person","person_id":"twd_erg_kmz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"廙","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"馬俊","kind":"person","person_id":"0w5_r48_tfo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002:m0021","start":